title: solar_parasite_start
tags: star
---
Orbiting close to the star is a creature... or a ship... that looks like a tick. It has extended a siphon into the star and is sucking plasma. It hasn't noticed you. #line:solar_parasite_start_00
-> Kill It #line:solar_parasite_start_01
    <<start_combat encounter_solar_parasite>>
-> Siphon the Parasite #line:solar_parasite_start_02
    <<jump solar_parasite_parasite_flee>>
-> Study #line:solar_parasite_start_03
    <<add_fact research_points 50>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: solar_parasite_parasite_flee
tags: 
---
You fill your tanks with super-charged plasma. The parasite detaches and flees into deep space, terrified of you. #line:solar_parasite_parasite_flee_00
-> Continue #line:solar_parasite_parasite_flee_01
    <<give_item resource_fuel 10>>
    <<set_fact trait_solar_charged_engines true>>
    <<stop>>
===

